													<Description classname='Str'>
														<value>This test is created for reproducing an issue that occured in India: Motion Type notificaitons were not received anymore after disconnecting and reconnecting. The issue could not be reproducted with this test case but we keep it anyway for possible future use.
The test case is not completely finished, there is an issue with the On-Fail action of the "Check if no notifications were logged" step: the "Check Motion Type Notifications again" sub-sequence is not called.

Do not execute this test untill we can really reproduce the issue with this test!</value>
